Nature's Karma System:
  - not inheritely "good" or "evil", more like a reputation with nature itself
  - certain actions cause positive or negative reputation
  - thresholds of reputation can cause things, such as:
    - gamestage changes
    - affect mob AI/aggression
    - maybe buffs
    - affect prices of greeblings
  - things that affect reputation:
    - killing specific mobs, both good and bad
    - doing certain actions maybe, like planting/harvesting crops
    - offerings?
  - similar to Sanity system in structure, except it doesn't automatically go up or down, only through actions
  - keep it somewhat generic so it can be used by other people in other ways as well



