  - books / entries could be given out as quest rewards as well
  - still have FTB quests or advancements as the main red thread through the pack
    - or should this also be a patchouli book using its quest system?
  - add the investigations to the book somewhere (maybe discoveries)
  Categories:
    Discoveries:
      - this contains entries that explain things more in the world
      - items in here need to be discovered before they appear in the book
      - each entry is assigned to an advancement that unlocks when the item has been acquired
