Arcane Archives x Thaumcraft Inventory Ideas:
  - upgraded Lectern block that can request items using golems
  - the interface of the new lectern block is a combination of the original lectern, and the golemancers bell logistics UI
  - clicking on an item no longer highlights the item in-world automatically, instead there is now a "Track" button that will do that
  - when clicking on an item, the "Request" button and amount slider from the golemancers bell logistics UI shows up at the bottom
  - clicking request will task a golem near that container to perform the same task as the golemancers bell with provider seals would do
  - additionally, if there is a container with a Store seal near the golem, they will prioritize delivering items to that, instead of the player
  - everytime something is requested, some vis is drawn from the environment (depending on the amount of items as well)
  - requires golem logistics research to unlock
  - probably infusion recipe, but that part isnt so important



