Story Ideas:
  - player starts in a void like world with a small hub
    - world is corrupted/being destroyed
  - npc (your friend?) is there trying to fix whatever is happening and asks you to investigate another dimension (BL)
    - gives you a (quest) book for your research (maybe he'll automatically get updates from it too?)
  - Once quest accepted, able to go to portal room to enter the BL
  - Can't teleport back (ever)
  - Goal is to research the dimensions corruption and find the cause
    - eventually leading to the Prime Wight
    - important to point out that the corruption isn't necessarily bad, as it also created new life forms
  - Instead, once a certain game stage has been unlocked (last quest), player can teleport back to a copy of the previous hub where things are looking:
    - better: your friend will be waiting for you report
    - worse: friend is gone but left a note
    - mentions that since the prime wight hasn't been found yet, you are kinda at a dead end for now but should remain in case more comes up
      - this is a cliffhanger until the BL actually gets the PW as a boss



